{x_bed
    {message
        output={@

Your bed is surprisingly large.
Sheets and blankets are thrown and piled over the mattress. A lone oversize pillow sits at the head.

(Hint: You can look under, behind or on items)
        }
    }
}

{x_on_bed
    {message
        output={@

On your bed there are various blankets kind of thrown over its surface. The topmost blanket is a shiny chrome. There is a large pile of pillows near the head of the bed.
        }
    }
}

{x_behind_bed
    {message
        output={@

As you are looking behind your bed you notice a string around one of the bedposts. It is a chrome bubble-shaped mask.
        }
    }
}

{x_under_bed
    {message
        output={@

Under your bed there are some candy wrappers and a few pairs of socks that appear to have been kicked under it.
        }
    }
}



{input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_your_bed))
    {act, logic=x_bed, tags=!_type|room }
}

{input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_on_your_bed))
    {act, logic=x_on_bed, tags=!_type|room }
}

{input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_behind_your_bed))
    {act, logic=x_behind_bed, tags=!_type|room }
}

{input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_under_your_bed))
    {act, logic=x_under_bed, tags=!_type|room }
}
